  "display_title": "Of Curse And Tide",
  "description": "After the long war between humans and mermaids, a curse took root deep within the royal bloodline. That curse flowed through generations, reaching even the young Crown Prince, Wook. Tormented by the Haunted Valley, Wook fled to a coastal temple for refuge. Still haunted by the hallucinations, he succumbed to them and threw himself off the cliff. Miraculously surviving death's door, Wook faced an unbelievable reality...\n\n *“I can save Your Highness from the curse.”*\n\n(Source: Lezhin, translated)",
